 -------------------------------------------------------------------

 Given an array of indexes A[].  Each index will point to array itself.  So write
 an algorithm to find out the number of loops in the array.

 (use three variables)

 sol.

 1.variable count =0 // for counting loops

 2.variable temp  // for parsing

 3.consider an additional array of the length equal to given array for status .

 4.madhu  consider each location of the A[0] and parse throu the array

  by making the status aray bit 1 for the visited locations.

  if there is a loop then  count ++ if not return

 hint:   ( use temp variable to parsing over the list )



 5.make status array all 0's ,

   againg repeat the procedure 4. for every location A[1] to A[n]



 6. count will give the no of loops

